UIUI S1 (revision full-1029-s16000-f16)
================================================================================

The bundled weights are a further modification of Phonon-2 by the uiui project:
all encoder linear layers were re-trained with 4-bit quantisation-aware training
(16-entry floating-point lookup tables per 16 output rows), and the decoder is
stored as uncompressed 16-bit floating point. Statements above about five-value
palettes and a 6-bit decoder describe the upstream package, not these weights.
uiui S1 weights are distributed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 as a cautious choice because
share-alike data was used in training. This licence does not settle the upstream
or data terms listed below; see section 9 of docs/technical-report.md.

Additional training data, as stated by each publisher:

